OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool airport to raise
OL,4,Adrop-off charge to #7
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe minimum charge for using Liverpool
OL,7,FJohn Lennon Airport's express drop-off
OL,8,Fcar park is to rise from #6 to #7 on 1
OL,9,FSeptember.
OL,11,FThe fee will cover stays of up to 10
OL,12,Fminutes and the same charge will
OL,13,Fcontinue to apply to black cab drivers
OL,14,Fusing the terminal rank, who typically
OL,15,Fpass it on to passengers as part of
OL,16,Ftheir fare.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40402
SC,0002
