OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1787927153
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALiverpool airport to raise
OL,4,Adrop-off charge to #7
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe airport blamed the additional
OL,7,Fcharge on rising business rates, higher
OL,8,Fenergy charges, National Insurance and
OL,9,Fminimum wage increases, but maintained
OL,10,Fa separate car park would remain free
OL,11,Ffor stays of up to 20 minutes.
OL,13,FIt said it was aware some black cab
OL,14,Fdrivers might choose not to work at the
OL,15,Fairport when the increase was
OL,16,Fintroduced, but it did not expect
OL,17,Fdisruption.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
